{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303354","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303354","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1430335401:1":{"text":"라이언이 쫓겨난 이유는 베일 아래 가려진 귀족의 얼굴을 봐서였대!","source_cn":"莱恩被赶走的原因，是他看见了贵族面纱下的真容！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB334EBC0F049FB6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430335402:1":{"text":"베일에 가려진 얼굴? 귀족들은 드래곤의 알 에센스을 너무 많이 먹어서 드래곤화가 되었다던데.","source_cn":"面纱下的真容？我听说那些贵族因为喝了太多龙蛋清，因此产...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BBFD19FE024DD2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430335403:1":{"text":"맞아. 은혜의 이슬이 드래곤의 알 에센스일 줄 누가 알았겠어. 조금만 먹어서 다행이야...","source_cn":"是啊，谁知道恩典灵露竟然是龙蛋清，还好我喝的少……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB808B338F1035BC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民玛瑟琳":{"text":"평민 마슬린","source":"平民玛瑟琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:平民伊多":{"text":"평민 이드","source":"平民伊多","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}